WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
The more you eat, the more dirty you will be.

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:04,480
That’s why the more they eat, the more they become weak and the more they eat, the more evil they become.

3
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,560
It's not that I haven't eaten enough

4
00:00:05,560 --> 00:00:07,880
It’s this flesh, the body can’t be transformed

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:10,320
Then why did they leave so much blood?

6
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,280
All the teeth have fallen out

7
00:00:11,280 --> 00:00:12,760
That's another thing missing

8
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:15,240
The human body also needs something hidden in the grass and trees

9
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:17,120
Don’t touch vegetables and fruits for a long time

10
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:18,560
The blood vessels will become rotten little by little.

11
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,240
The teeth become loose and fall out

12
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:23,280
In serious cases, even the internal qi will rupture and bleed.

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:26,340
That's why you asked us to spit out the bones and make soup

14
00:00:26,340 --> 00:00:28,060
Eat loosely Eat loosely, boil water and drink

15
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:30,860
Yes, there is fat in the spit bones that is not found in the meat.

16
00:00:30,860 --> 00:00:33,620
That pine needle water contains something that can prevent scurvy.

17
00:00:33,620 --> 00:00:36,460
Let's eat spit meat and drink bone broth and pine needle water.

18
00:00:36,460 --> 00:00:42,840
The missing two medicines have been replenished. Where can I go?

19
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:45,430
to save people

20
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:46,950
Save those who are still alive

21
00:00:46,950 --> 00:00:48,030
save them

22
00:00:48,030 --> 00:00:50,550
Brother Mouchuan, these white wolves bullied us so much back then.

23
00:00:50,550 --> 00:00:52,430
He still wants to rob our house and our meat.

24
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:53,390
Why save them?
